  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759129,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Classic Book Collection: Alice's Adventures in Wonderland - Nintendo DS\n\nJourney down the rabbit hole with Nintendo's *100 Classic Book Collection* and experience Lewis Carroll's beloved *Alice's Adventures in Wonderland* like never before on your Nintendo DS! This unique e-book collection transforms your handheld into a portable library, allowing you to immerse yourself in Alice's whimsical and nonsensical world.\n\nHold your DS like a book and navigate through Carroll's fantastical tale, adjusting text size and background music to create your perfect reading environment. Utilize the bookmark feature to save your progress and easily resume your adventure. Explore the story through the game's search function, discovering fascinating details about the author and the novel itself. \n\nThis edition, part of a collection featuring 100 public domain works, offers a charming and accessible way to rediscover a literary classic.  While the DS screen presents a unique reading experience, the game's features enhance the enjoyment, making *Alice's Adventures in Wonderland* a delightful and engaging experience for readers of all ages.  Prepare to be captivated by talking animals, mad tea parties, and a world turned delightfully upside down!"
    },
